  "notes": "COMMON COMPOUNDS:\n・{在学|ざいがく}{中|ちゅう} (while enrolled in school)\n・{在学|ざいがく}{生|せい} (enrolled student, current student)\n・{在学|ざいがく}{証明書|しょうめいしょ} (certificate of enrollment)\n・{在学|ざいがく}{期間|きかん} (period of enrollment)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{通学|つうがく} - commuting to school\n・{在籍|ざいせき} - being registered/enrolled (more general, also for organizations)\n\n[Register: Formal]",
